<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002T_S000D" variety="S000D">
<name>Other Electrical</name>
<ttl id="1002T_S000D_742B1_T003C" variety="T003C">
<name>ETC System</name>
<para id="RM00000365B014X" category="C" type-id="803NM" name-id="CM0FB-02" from="200912">
<dtccode>B15CA</dtccode>
<dtcname>ETC antenna not connected</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000365B014X_01" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IA400000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>This DTC is output when the ETC antenna (navigation antenna assembly) has been disconnected or the cable has been open</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.54in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.25in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.29in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC.No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B15CA</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Antenna cord not connected or open</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Navigation Antenna Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Toll Collection (ETC) Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000365B014X_02" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000365B014X_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000365B014X_03_0013" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IA600000">
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the DTCs following the screen. (For the procedure, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000OCQ05PX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Select "Clear" on the screen display and clear the DTCs following the screen.  </ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000365B014X_03_0014" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000365B014X_03_0014" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IA700000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs again and proceed to the destination below.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Code (B15CA) output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Code (B15CA) not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>This DTC may be recorded when other parts are replaced.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000365B014X_03_0012" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000365B014X_03_0008" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000365B014X_03_0012" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IA500000">
<testtitle>Inspect Navigation Antenna Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten4>
<ptxt>The navigation antenna assembly is an integrated antenna combining the GPS antenna and ETC antenna.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect Installation Condition</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check the navigation antenna assembly cord for installation problems such as sharp bends, pinching and incompletely engaged connectors.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Installation normal</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect Resistance (ETC Antenna)</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E101146J17" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the navigation antenna assembly connector shown in the illustration.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between terminals 1 - 2 of the connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1 - 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 10 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<table>
<title>Text in Illustrations</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.41in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.72in"/>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*a</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<ptxt>Connector Disconnected</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Navigation Antenna Assembly)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000365B014X_03_0017" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000365B014X_03_0009" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000365B014X_03_0017" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IA800000">
<testtitle>Replace Toll Collection (ETC) Computer Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Replace the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly with a new one. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002TPV001X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000365B014X_03_0024" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000365B014X_03_0024" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IA100000">
<testtitle>Operation Check
</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check Area Around Antenna</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check for any obstructions around the navigation antenna assembly (top surface of the instrument panel), and remove them if present.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check for any film, stickers, etc. affixed to the windshield glass, and remove them if present.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect with ETC On-board Unit Tester</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E195388J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using an ETC on-board unit tester, check that the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly is performing wireless communication normally.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Operate the ETC on-board unit tester at a position approximately 1m from the windshield glass, on a line extending upward and forward of the vehicle from the navigation antenna assembly at an elevation angle of 67±15°. ((The distance between the ETC on-board unit tester and the antenna is only a guide)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Point the communication surface of the ETC on-board unit tester toward the navigation antenna assembly.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Do not bring the ETC on-board unit tester too close to the navigation antenna assembly, as communication with the tester may be established even if the antenna is disconnected.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Setup</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Perform setup.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check Using ETC Card</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Insert an ETC card into the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly and check that the card is authenticated normally.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<table>
<title>Text in Illustrations</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.41in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.72in"/>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*1</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ETC On-board Unit Tester</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>*2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Navigation Antenna Assembly</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content6><res>
<down ref="RM00000365B014X_03_0018" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000365B014X_03_0018" proc-id="RM0550J___0000IA900000">
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70201</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), recheck the DTCs.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Code (B15CA) not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Code (B15CA) output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000365B014X_03_0011" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000365B014X_03_0010" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000365B014X_03_0011">
<testtitle>END</testtitle>
</testgrp>
